@baseUrl = {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}

### ── Auth ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Admin login (trả JWT, dùng cho admin app)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0395359198",
  "password": "password"
}

### Reindex all items into Meilisearch (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/reindex?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Reindex all schools/teachers into Meilisearch (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/reindex/users?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### ── Dashboard ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Stats tổng quan theo kỳ
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/stats?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Chart tăng trưởng user
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/chart/users?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Chart GMV
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/chart/gmv?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Top partners
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/top-partners?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Top items (khóa học)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/top-items?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### ── Users ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Danh sách thành viên
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Lọc theo role
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=teacher&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Tìm kiếm
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?q=nguyen&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Chi tiết user
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Cập nhật user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 1,
  "role": "user"
}

### ── Items ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Danh sách khóa học
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/items?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Chi tiết khóa học
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Cập nhật khóa học
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 1,
  "userStatus": 1
}

### ── Orders ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Danh sách đơn hàng
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Lọc theo trạng thái
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders?status=pending&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Chi tiết đơn hàng
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Xác nhận thanh toán bank transfer (bulk)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": [1, 2, 3] }

### Huỷ đơn hàng (bulk)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": [1, 2, 3] }

### ── Transactions ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Danh sách giao dịch (pending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/transactions?status=0&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Chi tiết giao dịch
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/transactions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Duyệt giao dịch (bulk)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/transactions/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": [1, 2, 3] }

### Từ chối giao dịch (bulk)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/transactions/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": [1, 2, 3] }

### ── Articles ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Danh sách bài viết
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/articles?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Chi tiết bài viết
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/articles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Cập nhật bài viết
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/articles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 1,
  "isHot": 0
}

### ── Config ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Xem tất cả config
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/config
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Cập nhật config key
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/config/some_key
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": "new_value" }

### ── Notification ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Send system notification to user by phone
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/notification/send?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0395359198",
  "type": "system_notif",
  "title": "Thông báo từ anyLEARN",
  "content": "Nội dung thông báo hiển thị cho user.",
  "route": ""
}

### send test order notif
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/notification/send?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "0395359198", "type": "order", "title": "Test email anyLEARN", "content": "Thư thử" }

### ── ZNS (Zalo Token Setup) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Bước 1: Lấy Zalo OAuth URL (mở URL này trong browser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/zns/authorize
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Bước 2: Zalo tự redirect về /admin/zns/callback?code=... (không cần gọi thủ công)
# Nếu cần test: GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/zns/callback?code=CODE_FROM_ZALO



### Orders waiting for payment: waiting now, reminded, paid after a reminder, expired (admin)
GET http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/dashboard/pending-orders?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}


### Price reports sent by visitors (admin) and one update
GET http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/price-reports
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/price-reports/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "fixed", "adminNote": "Đã chỉnh giá theo đối tác" }


### Tag dictionary: list (usage count per tag), create, edit, merge
GET http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bóng rổ", "group": "sport" }

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/tags/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "group": "sport", "status": 1 }

###
POST http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/tags/2/merge
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "intoId": 1 }

### Set the tags of a course
PUT http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/items/1697
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tagIds": [1, 4] }


### Partner branches: list, search an address (Google), place details, create
GET http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/locations?userId=14422
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/locations/autocomplete?q=12 nguyen hue&session=abc
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/locations/place?placeId=PLACE_ID&session=abc
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 14422, "title": "Cơ sở Quận 1", "address": "12 Nguyễn Huệ, Quận 1", "lat": 10.7745, "lng": 106.7032, "provinceName": "Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh", "districtName": "Quận 1" }


### Save several places picked from the address search (head office = headPlaceId)
POST http://localhost:8080/v2/admin/locations/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 14422, "placeIds": ["PLACE_ID_1", "PLACE_ID_2"], "headPlaceId": "PLACE_ID_2" }


### ── Collections ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List collections
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/collections?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Suggest / search courses to add (same filters as the public search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/collections/course-search?q=bong&ageFrom=8&ageTo=10&freeTrial=true&api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Create a collection (itemIds = the courses, in order)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/collections?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hè không màn hình",
  "subtitle": "Hoạt động ngoài trời cho bé nghỉ hè",
  "seasonFrom": "2026-06-01",
  "seasonTo": "2026-08-31",
  "itemIds": []
}

### Plan 07: run the reminder scan + send due notifications now (admin only; hourly job otherwise)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/lifecycle/run?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Plan 07: read / change the lifecycle settings (same page as the other operation settings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/settings?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/settings?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lifecycleEnabled": true, "preStartDays": [3, 1], "absentStreak": 2, "surveyPercent": 50, "surveyLowScore": 2,
  "renewSessionsLeft": 3, "renewDaysBefore": 14, "feeDays": [7, 1], "sendFromHour": 8, "sendToHour": 21,
  "earlyRenewBonusPoints": 50 }

### Plan 08: pathways (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/pathways?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/pathways?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bóng đá: từ U13 đến U15", "subtitle": "Học liên tục cùng một sân", "active": true,
  "steps": [ { "itemIds": [1], "note": "" }, { "itemIds": [2, 3], "note": "Hai lớp thay thế nhau, cho bé đã thạo kỹ thuật cơ bản" } ] }

### Plan 08: views, clicks and orders per kind of suggestion (default last 30 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/recommendations/stats?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### AI suggestions: usage, clicks, orders, feedback (last 30 days by default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/ai-suggestions/stats?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Payment methods (back office page "Phương thức thanh toán")
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/payment-methods
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/payment-methods
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"methods": [{"key": "bank_transfer", "enabled": true, "min": 0, "max": 0, "label": ""}, {"key": "installment", "enabled": true, "min": 3000000, "max": 0, "label": ""}]}


### Vui học: log of everything that happens in the games (game = checkin|quiz|sticker|explore|banner|ref)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fun/events?game=checkin&page=1&size=30
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Vui học: check-in settings and today's numbers
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fun/checkin-config
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Vui học: save the check-in settings (7 day values, 0 to 1000; dailyCap 0 = no limit)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/fun/checkin-config
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true, "dayPoints": [5, 5, 10, 10, 15, 15, 20], "dailyCap": 0}

### Quiz question bank (plan 14): overview matrix + settings + latest generation runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/quiz-bank/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Ask the AI for one batch of a cell (topic: parenting|english|music|art|science, difficulty 1-3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/quiz-bank/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "topic": "science", "difficulty": 1, "count": 10 }

### Review queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/quiz-bank/questions?status=pending&page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Approve / hide (status: active|hidden|pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/quiz-bank/questions/status
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": [1, 2, 3], "status": "active" }

